s://youtu.be/H9q2FT3LhNw?t=1540","stats"]},{"field":"multipliers.ast","text":"His perimeter role brings assists and steals (3.1 ast, 1.1 stl last season). Fantrax drags both down.","sources":["https://youtu.be/H9q2FT3LhNw?t=1606","stats"]},{"field":"gp","text":"He played 74 games in each of the last two seasons with no recurring injury. Yahoo's 70 is a bit low.","sources":["stats"]},{"field":"mpg","text":"Atlanta is very cautious with his minutes, so about 30.","sources":["https://youtu.be/4gw4W4RTolY?t=938"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}